[5.492644, "o", "-- REQ-UA-004 | openspec/changes/add-mfa/specs/user-auth/spec.md:5 | active | requested\r\n"]
[5.494489, "o", "### Requirement: REQ-UA-004 Second factor\r\n"]
[5.494762, "o", "The system SHALL ask for a TOTP code after a valid password.\r\n"]
[5.495123, "o", "\r\n#### Scenario: SCN-UA-004-1 Valid code\r\n- **WHEN** the user enters the current TOTP code\r\n- **THEN** the system opens a session\r\n\r\n#### Scenario: SCN-UA-004-2 Expired code\r\n- **WHEN** the user enters a code older than 30 seconds\r\n- **THEN** the system rejects it\r\n\r\n"]
